.TH PORTWHY 1
.SH NAME
portwhy \\- explain local listener ownership
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B portwhy
portwhy --port NUMBER [--format json]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Combines local listener evidence into an ownership explanation and reports partial visibility.
.SH OPTIONS
Use \fBportwhy --help\fR for the complete, version-specific flag list.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Uses the shared CLI status convention: 0 success, 1 a completed negative finding or policy failure, 2 invalid usage, 3 a partial result, and 4 a runtime failure. Not every status applies to every command.
